<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE OKS VIOHALCO MERGER.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE OKS VIOHALCO MERGER.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the prospectus on the merger of Viohalko SA with Biem SA, Elem SA, Epem SA and Tourism and Real Estate SA.</p>
<p>Viohalko will absorb the above companies and raise its share capital by 1.6 billion drachmas. Advisor on the merger was Sigma Securities.</p>
<p>Viohalko shareholders will exchange their shares with new ones -- one to 1.5. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
